OL,5,G2305 999: Critical Condition
OL,6,     FWhen Duncan is admitted to Royal
OL,7,     FStoke emergency department after
OL,8,     Ffalling down a full flight of
OL,9,     Fstairs onto concrete, trauma team
OL,10,     Fleader Richard Hall fears the
OL,11,     Fworst.
OL,12,G0005 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Natalia Spierings helps Justin
OL,14,     Fwho has a genetic condition which
OL,15,     Fmeans his skin is covered in lumps
OL,16,     Fmade up of nerves. Dr Dev Shah is
OL,17,     Fasked to remove a cyst named
OL,18,     FEgbert.
