OL,8,     FTyne, and when they pull it over,
OL,9,     Fa search uncovers a crack pipe.
OL,10,     FAnd PC Martain Anderson stakes out
OL,11,     Fa suspected drug driver.
OL,12,G0210 Police Interceptors
